 "intro_zh": "百色起义纪念馆位于广西百色市迎龙山公园内，始建于1961年。纪念馆共有七个展厅，分百色风雷、革命英杰、邓小平与百色、建设新百色四个部分，陈列革命文物和图片资料1400多件（幅）。",
 "intro_en": "The Baise Uprising Memorial Hall is located in Yinglongshan Park, Baise City, Guangxi. It was built in 1961. The memorial hall has seven exhibition halls, divided into four sections: Baise Fenglei, Revolutionary Heroes, Deng Xiaoping and Baise, and Construction of New Baise. More than 1,400 pieces of revolutionary cultural relics and pictures are displayed.",
